                {
                  "@type": "PropertyValue",
                  "name": "Graphics",
                  "value": "The shape of the sign follows the silhouette of your trade’s symbol – a tooth, scissors, a heart, a key, a glass or anything a customer instantly connects with your business."
                },
                {
                  "@type": "PropertyValue",
                  "name": "Suitable for",
                  "value": "Businesses with an iconic symbol instantly linked to their trade – dental surgeries (a tooth), hairdressers (scissors), cafés (a cup), wine shops (a vine), credit unions (a key)."
